WEBVTT

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.840
"Han"

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:35.030
Meng Wu!

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.330
It's over.

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:20.550
"The Mightiest Man"

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:34.480
M-Meng Wu, defeated...

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:37.820
He'll... he'll be killed!

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:39.860
--Like hell he will!
--Not so fast!

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:42.950
Do you mean to dim the glory
Meng Wu's won on the battlefield?

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:45.660
If we intervene now,

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:48.710
his name will be sullied
for generations to come!

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:51.040
So we just watch him get slaughtered?!

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.460
It's a duel between generals!
That's how it is!

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:57.300
But the moment Meng Wu is slain,

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:00.220
we'll all attack Han Ming.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.100
After Han Ming,
the Chu soldiers around us.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:05.220
We'll take as many as we can with us

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:08.520
as we follow in Meng Wu's
footsteps together!

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.100
All right.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.480
Get ready.

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:16.230
We'll get the jump on those fools--
right after Han Ming's next blow.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.230
Right.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:37.960
Meng Wu.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:44.800
Meng Wu.

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.180
Meng Wu.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:57.480
A long and storied military career,

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.650
a general's ranks...

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:03.700
If the might of these things really
does rest on one's shoulders,

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:08.080
Han Ming may well be the
Middle Kingdom's mightiest.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.830
When the time comes,

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:15.710
he'll likely resemble an unshakable
mountain--even to you.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:18.880
Han Ming is the stronger man.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:28.060
But I have faith.

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:39.780
Faith that you, Meng Wu, will be
the man who tears him down.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.320
Meng Wu, sir!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:43.360
Not quite dead yet, eh?

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:46.160
You need no justification.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.490
With this one fight,
you will show the heavens...

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:56.460
...exactly who the
mightiest man really is!

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:08.140
Broken?

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:12.390
The great Han Ming's arm, <i>broken</i>?

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:15.140
Meng Wu, you bastard.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.100
You'll pay.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.690
You'll pay for this!

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:19.900
Meng Wu!

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.780
Han Ming!

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:27.990
I am the strongest in the Middle Kingdom!

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.080
Father...

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:39.790
Ba Miu.

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:41.000
Y-Y-Yes?

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:43.800
Call Yan over.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.800
You mean... Wa Yan?

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:50.970
What is it, sister?

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.020
Get yourself in there

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:56.640
and stab Meng Wu in the heart from behind.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:57.640
Wha--

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:01.770
"Wa"

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:01.770
N-Now wait just a moment, Wa Lin, ma'am!

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:05.570
Han Ming won't take that kind
of behavior sitting down!

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:08.570
One wrong move and Han Ming's
army'll come for u--

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:11.950
Calm yourself, Ba Miu.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:14.290
My sister is well aware.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:20.630
But perhaps she can share
her reasons with her fool brother.

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:23.960
No one can take Han Ming's place,
for better or for worse.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:27.260
Even I can't handle his army.

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:30.390
If Han Ming really were
to fall to Meng Wu...

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:35.140
Well, to put it simply,
this battlefield would be done for.

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:40.980
Besides, I don't care to entertain the
whimsies of silly men and their duels.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:45.360
And if Han Ming grows angry
once Meng Wu is slain?

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:48.280
Fall back to this position.

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:50.450
I'll handle the rest.

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:51.990
Understood.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:53.280
I need ten horsemen!

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:57.870
The cavalry!

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.710
No--just a few horses?

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:04.210
"Qin"

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:09.800
Oh! Both of their weapons
are deeply cracked!

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:13.800
Never mind that--these two are almost...

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:25.150
Neither one can take much more.

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:28.570
A few more blows and
we'll have our winner.

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:30.740
Pardon.

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:34.280
Wa Lin's flag?!

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.870
What's it doing here?

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:40.000
Make way! Clear a path!

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.370
M-Meng Tian!

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:43.710
Will I make it in time?

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:48.840
Father...

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:54.850
H-Han Ming...

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.180
Meng Wu...

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:03.650
"Hangu Pass"

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:07.070
Meng Ao, sir!
They're struggling back here!

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.900
Concentrate troops at the lower right!

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:11.860
Send some out front as well!

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:13.610
That's all we can--

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:14.620
Hmm?

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:19.540
An ill omen? Surely not...

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.550
Th-This is it...

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:32.300
It's almost over!

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:16.930
Tch.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:18.430
So fast!

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:20.100
Tch!

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.060
One more push!

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:31.480
Shit.

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:34.610
This stage is where
we learn who's strongest.

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:36.910
Do <i>not </i>befoul it, you boor!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.920
What's wrong, Meng Wu?

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:52.050
Our battle is not yet over!

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:06.810
Th... the mightiest... is...

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:10.980
Meng Wu, stop!

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:12.360
Han... Mi--

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:25.040
"Coalition Army HQ"

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:29.830
What's with the cheering?
That's not right!

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:31.080
Don't tell me...

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:39.640
Meng Wu has slain Han Ming,
commanding general of Chu!

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:42.100
Meng Wu!

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:43.470
Han Ming...

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:56.280
C-Captain! The next
battlefield over--they're--

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.490
Yeah!

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:01.160
That's <i>definitely </i>our guys cheerin'!

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:04.540
Musta pulled off somethin' huge, dammit!

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:12.880
What is it, Xin?

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:14.040
Nothin'!

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:17.050
Gear's wearin' out, that's all.

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:19.550
Stay with us, Meng Tian!

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:21.680
Open your eyes, young lord--please!

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.100
Meng Tian!

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:25.100
--Meng Tian!
--Meng Tian!

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:26.600
Meng Tian!

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:32.270
Kill Meng Wu!

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:34.270
Kill them <i>all</i>!

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:37.690
M-Meng Wu, sir!
We should withdraw for now!

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:40.780
Given time, the news of
Han Ming's death will spread,

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:43.070
and the enemy will fall to pieces!

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.080
Defend Meng Wu!

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:58.510
Meng Wu, sir, a moment?

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.630
Please, a word for the young lord!

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:04.760
He--he is gravely wounded...

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:07.310
And his pulse is nearly...

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:10.270
One last word for the
young lord--please, sir!

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:11.350
Meng Wu!

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:12.730
Meng Wu!

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:15.860
I have no words to give him.

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:17.860
Wha-- Meng Wu, sir!

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:19.150
But how?!

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:21.280
After what the young lord did for you...

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.030
Silence!

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:28.450
Why did he leave his post
and come here in the first place?

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:30.910
He'll be getting an earful, all right.

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:34.330
What are you... what are you saying?!

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:35.790
Meng Tian, he's...

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:38.920
Please, sir--a word now, at the very end!

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:42.670
He will not die!

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:45.090
He's the son of the great Meng Wu!

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:49.310
<i>That </i>won't be enough to kill him!

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:50.810
Meng Wu...

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:57.900
Oh! For a moment there,
Meng Tian's hand--it moved!

00:12:57.900 --> 00:12:59.530
What?!

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:02.490
Take him to the back at once.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:05.240
Meng Wu, sir, fall back! The enemy!

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:08.620
There's something I still have to do!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:13.500
Meng Wu?!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:17.170
Kill him! Finish him off!

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.210
Meng Wu...

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:21.920
Where did he find the strength?

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:32.350
What even <i>is </i>this man?!

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:36.310
And right after his pitched
battle with Han Ming!

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:38.150
How can he be so powerful?

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:41.980
Is he some kind of <i>monster</i>?!

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:44.440
Follow Meng Wu!

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:46.200
We'll finish this!

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:51.330
Wa Yan has returned.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.620
Is he hurt?

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:57.710
To think the great Han Ming
could actually be slain...

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.210
Wa Lin, ma'am, isn't this...

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:09.430
So the big galoot went
and got himself killed!

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:16.100
I guess that means I've been
promoted a rank, eh?

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:21.770
But... Wa Lin, ma'am,
this is no laughing matter!

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:24.940
What are we going to do now?

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:27.200
Not a thing. We're heading back.

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.030
Eh?

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:32.580
Like I said earlier:
I can't rally Han Ming's army.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.620
Not that I want to.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:40.420
Besides, we only ever came
here to watch and kill time.

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:42.750
Still, what a shocker.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:48.720
So I'm not the only monster
who's a relative unknown,

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:50.090
Meng Wu.

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:54.260
The main army, led by Meng Wu,

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:56.600
broke through the center
of Han Ming's army.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.190
They went on to rout Ren Ao's main camp,

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:03.400
then rushed into the melees on
the left and right to provide support.

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:06.240
Look! Reinforcements!

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:11.820
"Chu"

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:11.820
Fall back for now! Hurry!

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:13.280
All troops, withdraw!

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:15.240
"Qin" "Meng"

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:18.330
General Meng Wu!

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:20.250
Wait--can this mean...

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:24.800
Day 15 of the Battle of Hangu Pass.

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:29.300
On the day the coalition army
had marked for the final battle,

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:31.590
the Meng Wu Army claimed
a definitive victory

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:34.760
on the Meng Wu-Han Ming battlefield.

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.480
Although there was a time lag,

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:43.730
"Xianyang"

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:43.730
this game-changing news was
conveyed to both main camps.

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:46.070
this game-changing news was
conveyed to both main camps.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:48.190
General Meng Wu is victorious!

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:53.070
Naturally, their reactions
were polar opposites.

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:54.990
Well done, General Meng Wu!

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:56.080
Yes!

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:59.500
That's my Meng Wu for you.

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:04.880
It worked--

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:07.210
Lord Changping's daring strategy

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:11.380
to attack the Chu army with
Meng Wu rather than defend!

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:13.260
Meng Wu...

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:15.760
High Commander...

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:18.350
This is <i>big</i>, you know.

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.190
Yes.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:31.530
The other battlefields were likewise
shaken up by the news of Han Ming's death.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:32.740
Can this be true?!

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.530
And at the hand of Meng Wu himself!

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:37.910
--Hoo--
--Hooray!

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:39.200
Yes!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:41.460
Meng Ao, shouting like that?

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.080
And <i>twice</i>!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:46.880
That's just how big this news is!

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:49.840
Tell every last troop the news!

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:51.840
We'll boost their sagging morale

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:53.880
"One Floor Down: The Huan Yi Army"

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:53.880
right back up where it belongs!

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:54.930
"One Floor Down: The Huan Yi Army"

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:54.930
Hurry!

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.140
Sure is loud.

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:00.430
The enemy's run out of time, too.

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:04.100
Before our Qin troops pour in
from the neighboring battlefield,

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:06.060
they'll be coming by to settle this!

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:08.230
Go ahead and deploy all our reserves!

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.780
Prepare for a violent attack!

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:11.440
Y-Yes, sir!

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:14.030
But if we can make it through this...

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:17.990
...this battlefield will see
the light at last!

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:23.160
A truly outstanding job, Wu...

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:38.850
"Wei"

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:38.850
Fengming, sir, shouldn't we send
some troops to defend the left?

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:40.810
Not necessary!

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:44.350
But the foe approaches from
the next battlefield over...

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:47.230
The Chu army isn't <i>completely </i>wiped out.

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:50.320
The enemy won't be
storming in that quickly.

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:57.360
Besides, when they do, they'll run
headfirst into the Han army to our left.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:59.830
We'll use them as a shield to start.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.790
Then we'll come up with a plan.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:06.210
But the reality is that we
now have a time limit.

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:08.040
Mobilize all our archers.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:10.090
Use every last arrow if you must!

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:11.500
Sir!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:13.920
Send in the main army's elite unit!

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:18.510
Get over that wall and open the gate
from the inside--no matter what!

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:20.050
Sir!

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:21.140
Tch.

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:24.850
Damn Chu army. Coalition leader, my foot.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:27.770
You're just holding me back.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:29.100
And yet...

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:32.610
Perhaps we can stand
to gain from it, after all.

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:35.190
After we've crushed Qin in this war,

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:38.950
the Chu army will become
Wei's most formidable foe.

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:42.160
And their representative,
General Han Ming...

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:46.830
...just <i>had </i>to go and die on them.

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:50.880
Leave it to Wu Fengming.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:55.090
Wholly unflappable, even in
the face of Han Ming's death.

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:58.630
Bolstering offense is
exactly the right move.

00:18:58.630 --> 00:18:59.840
Still...

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:03.810
The aftermath of Han Ming's death
and his army's defeat

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:09.060
will clearly be felt on each
and every battlefield.

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:15.480
Leaving that solely to Wu Fengming
could be considered a bit risky.

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:17.190
Summon Kaine for me, please.

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:18.320
Sir!

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.950
Wait, Li Mu.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:24.030
Don't make your move just yet.
The Chu army's not done for.

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:29.580
We just have to keep Meng Wu's army
from spilling onto another battlefield!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.210
How?

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:34.960
I'll go mobilize Han Ming's army myself.

00:19:34.960 --> 00:19:36.760
You'd better not.

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:40.050
If you're not careful,
you could lose your life as well.

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.510
What?!

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:45.890
I understand how you feel,
but please, calm yourself.

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:50.350
Nothing good can come of acting
so soon on the site of a lost battle.

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:58.440
First of all, I recommend that
Wa Lin's army withdraw for now.

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:04.280
The immediate threat is that it will be
targeted by both Meng Wu and Teng.

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:07.120
Report! Report!

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:10.830
A message from General Wa Lin
to the coalition army HQ!

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:17.210
"Victory is right before our eyes.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:21.050
High commander,
prepare to enter Hangu Pass"!

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:22.180
Her words, sirs!

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:27.470
What... what in blazes?!

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:32.900
Ugh, so hot!

00:20:36.820 --> 00:20:38.860
"Yu"

00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:42.240
--Xiang Yi!
--Tch. Whoa!

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:44.740
--Lemme go, damn you!
--Xiang Yi, stop!

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:46.740
We can't take any more!
We're being slaughtered!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:50.370
Hey, you! Teng! Bring it on!

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:52.580
That's enough for today.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.370
And just why are we retreating,

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:55.750
<i>ma'am</i>?

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:58.460
I was <i>this close </i>to having Teng's head!

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:00.130
Knock it off, Yi, you idiot!

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.090
Do you want to die?!

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:02.800
Shut up! Let me go!

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.220
Oh?

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:07.260
You want to sleep with me that badly, hmm?

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.140
It ain't funny, damn you!

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:14.060
First Han Ming gets himself killed,
then this army gets its ass kicked!

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:16.270
So the huge nation of Chu
and all its troops

00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:18.770
are losin' to a bunch
of mountain monkeys?!

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:19.650
Gimme a break!

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:20.980
Hey now, Yi!

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:22.740
This ain't no joke.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:24.860
How are you gonna step up here?

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:27.950
You're the only commander we have left!

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:32.500
Take down Teng now and
we can even the playing field!

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:34.870
The Wa Lin Army is
still alive and kickin'!

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:36.290
Ain't that right, <i>ma'am</i>?

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:37.460
Yi!

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:40.550
How dare you talk to Wa Lin like that!

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:44.720
Can I kill him?
Can I just kill this guy already?

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:48.680
Don't. He's a fool,
but he's not incompetent.

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:51.220
No, this is a man who's worth breaking in.

00:21:51.220 --> 00:21:53.560
Just like you, Ba Miu.

00:21:55.440 --> 00:21:59.230
Xian Yi. Quit all your fussing
with that moron face of yours.

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:02.690
If this battle were about scoring
Teng's and Meng Wu's heads,

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:06.820
I would have done that
myself at the very start.

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:08.570
Whaddya mean?

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:11.240
That's <i>exactly </i>what this battle's about!

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:12.580
Wrong.

00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:14.960
The point of this entire battle

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:17.330
is to conquer Hangu Pass.

00:22:19.670 --> 00:22:24.170
No, 'cause, see?
We crush the Qin guys in front of us,

00:22:24.170 --> 00:22:25.920
get through the mountains in the back,

00:22:25.920 --> 00:22:27.760
and take Hangu Pass from behind--

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:30.350
If you're taking Hangu Pass from behind,

00:22:30.350 --> 00:22:33.470
crushing the Qin army
would be a way to do it.

00:22:33.470 --> 00:22:36.890
But it's not the <i>only </i>way, now, is it?

00:22:36.890 --> 00:22:37.730
Eh?

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:39.560
What... what do you mean?

00:22:41.820 --> 00:22:46.700
That's right: the elite unit
under Wa Lin's command...

00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:48.660
They've vanished--all 5,000 of them!

00:22:52.410 --> 00:22:57.330
Not a single one of you noticed, did you?

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:00.250
Starting with the war elephants.

00:23:00.250 --> 00:23:01.960
Surrounding their troops.

00:23:01.960 --> 00:23:05.090
Then I myself make an appearance

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:08.380
and leave for the neighboring battlefield.

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:10.590
It was all smoke and mirrors.

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:14.180
One grand distraction, all of it!

00:23:14.180 --> 00:23:20.150
And the <i>real </i>stars will already
have reached their destination!

00:24:54.280 --> 00:24:58.200
Next on <i>Kingdom</i>: "Beyond Hangu Pass."
